# The demo at the top of the README. Render it with:
#   termreel render examples/demo.reel -o examples/demo.svg
@size 64x18
@title termreel demo
@prompt [bold #61afef]~/site[/] [#c678dd]❯[/]
@typing 20

$ python build.py
@sleep 1.2
~ git push
> [dim]To github.com:you/site.git[/]
>    [yellow]a1f9e3c..7bd20c4[/]  main -> main
@sleep 2
